<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21693" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαυρ-ιάω</span></b> , mostly pres. Aet. and 
			Med.
		, aor. 1
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγαυρίασα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ju.</u>
					9.7
				</span></i>
			:—<i>bear</i> oneself <i>proudly, prance</i>,
			prop. of horses, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαυριῶντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυσῶντα καὶ γαυριώμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					10.16
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be splendid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαυριῶσαι . . τράπεζαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					301
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be luxuriant</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γῆ θάλλει καὶ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					4.155c
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.27
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.152
			</span></i>, al.: c. dat., <i>pride oneself on</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ ταύτῃ [τῇ ἥττῃ] γαυριᾷς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.244
				</span></i>
			; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί σφισι γαυριόωντες</span>
			(Mcineke <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όωντο</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.133
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Palaeph.
				1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				220iii3
			</span></i>.</div>
